<p>On May 3, a northbound bulk carrier near the Strait of Hormuz reported being attacked by multiple small craft about 11 nautical miles west of Sirik, Iran, according to the United Kingdom Maritime Trade Operations center. UKMTO said the crew was safe and no environmental impact had been reported, and no group immediately claimed responsibility. RT and RBC Ukraine reported a second maritime incident in the area, saying a tanker was struck near the Strait of Hormuz; RBC said the tanker was hit by unknown projectiles about 78 nautical miles north of Fujairah in the United Arab Emirates and that crews on both vessels were unharmed. AP reported at least two dozen attacks in and around the strait since the Iran war began.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/_kszh_VCEoINXgT4lbsT0GzywCK4TIaUfI6uQjlnPxX4INKSljTqO4kHLW2fsG3Lrv26jvNHrlTIMgotECQ1-GPtA9DP_E_9ppPgxb1r7WsDCrAKnh0JbR-lZHdk-Ez1aIXkSzKe2bY9FiYD-DDsrBD0x104xlgq2t7O-6ogwvbqSOBaJw' alt='A maritime image used with coverage of the reported attack near the Strait of Hormuz.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Unreleased vessel details: Reports did not identify the bulk carrier&#x27;s flag, owner, cargo or the attackers.</li><li>Local timing: JTBC reported that UKMTO said the Sirik-area incident occurred at about 3 p.m. Iran time.</li><li>U.S. blockade: Kurier reported that the United States had imposed a sea blockade against Iran and that CENTCOM said 49 ships had been stopped.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>UK Maritime Trade Operations: UKMTO described conditions in Hormuz and surrounding waters as “critical,” according to The Express Tribune. (<a href='https://tribune.com.pk/story/2606187/uk-maritime-agency-reports-attack-on-cargo-ship-west-of-irans-sirik-district'>The Express Tribune</a>)</li><li>Iranian authorities: Iran denied an attack, according to semiofficial Fars and Tabnak reports cited by AP. (<a href='https://www.wwaytv3.com/ship-is-attacked-near-strait-of-hormuz-as-iran-reviews-us-response-to-latest-proposal/'>WWAYTV3</a>)</li><li>Iranian officials: Iranian officials said they control the strait and that ships not affiliated with the United States or Israel may pass if they pay a toll. (<a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/us-israel-iran-war-cargo-ship-attacked-by-multiple-small-vessels-near-hormuz-strait-uk-military-11443482#publisher=newsstand'>NDTV</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/us-israel-iran-war-cargo-ship-attacked-by-multiple-small-vessels-near-hormuz-strait-uk-military-11443482#publisher=newsstand'>Cargo Ship Attacked By Multiple Small Vessels Near Hormuz Strait: UK Military</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/639407-cargo-vessels-struck-strait-monitor/'>Two cargo vessels struck near Strait of Hormuz – monitor</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/5/3/bulk-carrier-attacked-by-multiple-small-craft-off-iran-ukmto-says'>Bulk carrier attacked by multiple small craft off Iran, UKMTO says</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.axios.com/2026/05/03/trump-us-navy-iran-ships-strait-hormuz'>A bulk freighter reports being attacked by multiple small craft outside the strait, off Bandar Sirik, Iran.</a> - axios.com</li><li><a href='https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/tensions-intensify-at-strait-cargo-ship-sailing-near-hormuz-attacked-by-iran/articleshow/130743260.cms'>Tensions intensify at Strait: Cargo ship sailing near Hormuz attacked by Iran</a> - indiatimes.com</li><li><a href='http://www.adaderana.lk/news.php?nid=122040'>Cargo ship attacked off Iran approaching Strait of Hormuz</a> - adaderana.lk</li><li><a href='https://tribune.com.pk/story/2606187/uk-maritime-agency-reports-attack-on-cargo-ship-west-of-irans-sirik-district'>UK maritime agency reports attack on cargo ship west of Iran’s Sirik district</a> - tribune.com.pk</li><li><a href='https://www.wwaytv3.com/ship-is-attacked-near-strait-of-hormuz-as-iran-reviews-us-response-to-latest-proposal